{
  "id": "E408",
  "title": "“Baby”?",
  "level": "elementary",
  "date": "2020-02-29",
  "synopsis": "Why call one’s girlfriend “baby”? Paul gives a new explanation.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/50408/73729026cd7fac7e432404b9b92ecd8585a5aa00.mp3?1582277575",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "叫她“宝贝”？\n\n小乐：我妹妹的男朋友每天都叫她“宝贝”。她每天都很高兴！\n保罗：我希望那是一件好事。\n小乐：你不觉得这很浪漫吗？\n保罗：她的男朋友可能是不想叫错名字。\n小乐：有道理。但是，你怎么知道这么多？\n保罗：我是听说的。\n",
    "traditional": "叫她“寶貝”？\n\n小樂：我妹妹的男朋友每天都叫她“寶貝”。她每天都很高興！\n保羅：我希望那是一件好事。\n小樂：你不覺得這很浪漫嗎？\n保羅：她的男朋友可能是不想叫錯名字。\n小樂：有道理。但是，你怎麼知道這麼多？\n保羅：我是聽說的。\n"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Calling her “baby”?"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "小乐：我妹妹的男朋友每天都叫她“宝贝”。她每天都很高兴！",
      "traditional": "小樂：我妹妹的男朋友每天都叫她“寶貝”。她每天都很高興！",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè wǒ mèi mei de nán péng you měi tiān dōu jiào tā bǎo bèi tā měi tiān dōu hěn gāo xìng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le: My younger sister’s boyfriend always calls her “baby” every day. She’s very happy every day!"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "保罗：我希望那是一件好事。",
      "traditional": "保羅：我希望那是一件好事。",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó wǒ xī wàng nà shì yí jiàn hǎo shì",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: I hope that’s something good."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "小乐：你不觉得这很浪漫吗？",
      "traditional": "小樂：你不覺得這很浪漫嗎？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè nǐ bù jué de zhè hěn làng màn ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le: Don’t you think it’s very romantic?"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "保罗：她的男朋友可能是不想叫错名字。",
      "traditional": "保羅：她的男朋友可能是不想叫錯名字。",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó tā de nán péng you kě néng shì bù xiǎng jiào cuò míng zi",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: It might be that her boyfriend doesn’t want to say the wrong name."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "小乐：有道理。但是，你怎么知道这么多？",
      "traditional": "小樂：有道理。但是，你怎麼知道這麼多？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè yǒu dào li dàn shì nǐ zěn me zhī dào zhè me duō",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le: Makes sense. But, how come you know so much?"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "保罗：我是听说的。",
      "traditional": "保羅：我是聽說的。",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó wǒ shì tīng shuō de",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: I heard about it."
    }
  ],
